					"text" : "B. Assignment:\n\nUse these objects and others you know to create a Max program that concatenates equal length segements of the sounds in buffer a and buffer b on to buffer c.\n\n- Replace my meow and scrape files with your own wav files.\n\n- Make sure you are using equal length segments of your files.\n\n- The sound from buffer a should start at the beginning of buffer c and extend to halfway through buffer c.\n\n- The sound from buffer b should should start right after the sound from buffer a ends.\n\n- EMAIL ME A ZIP FILE of the directory including your Max patch AND your two audio files.\n\n"
				}

